flowchart TD
    ListStart([CLI 已解析/校验 List 参数]) --> ListInstalled{指定 --installed?}
    ListInstalled -->|否：Cloud| CloudList[Cloud List：无锁、无 Recover、无 Registry/Config]
    CloudList -->|失败| CloudFail[返回 fatal error：不渲染业务输出]
    CloudList -->|成功| CloudCompute[按可选 type 过滤；Type/Name/Version 排序]
    CloudCompute --> CloudRender[CLI 锁外渲染 `<type>/<name>@<version>`] --> CloudExit([退出])

    ListInstalled -->|是| Acquire[Acquire 全局 APM 锁]
    Acquire -->|失败| Fatal[返回 fatal error：不渲染业务输出]
    Acquire -->|成功| Recover[Recover transaction]
    Recover -->|失败| ReleaseFatal[尝试 Release]
    Recover -->|成功| Warn[锁内实时 Warn；无 journal 时 Debug]
    Warn --> Refresh[RefreshInstalled：复制注册 Agent、按字典序 Detect]
    Refresh -->|失败| ReleaseFatal
    Refresh -->|成功| Select{具体 Agent 或 all?}
    Select -->|具体 Agent 不在快照| ReleaseFatal
    Select -->|具体 Agent| ReadOne[锁内 Config.List]
    ReadOne -->|失败| ReleaseFatal
    ReadOne -->|成功| ReleaseSuccess[Release 全局锁]
    Select -->|all| ReadAll[锁内按快照字典序读取全部 Config]
    ReadAll --> PartialStore[保留逐 Agent 失败并继续]
    PartialStore --> ReleaseSuccess
    ReleaseFatal -->|Release 成功或失败| Fatal
    ReleaseSuccess -->|失败| Fatal
    ReleaseSuccess -->|成功| InstalledCompute[锁外按可选 type 过滤并排序]
    InstalledCompute --> HasPartial{存在 all 的读取失败?}
    HasPartial -->|否| InstalledRender[CLI 渲染 `<agent>/<type>/<name>@<version>`] --> InstalledExit([成功退出])
    HasPartial -->|是| PartialRender[唯一可渲染错误：先渲染成功记录] --> PartialError[CLI 记录一次 partial error、usage、非零退出]
